I go to the market.
This is the local market.
There is a lot of noise here.
There are many people on the street.
There are various colours everywhere.
The vendors call out loudly.
One vendor says, "There are fresh fruits!"
Another vendor says, "There are fresh vegetables!"
I have cloth bags in my hand.
I look at my shopping list.
Today I want tomatoes.
I also want spinach.
Here, all the items are fresh.
I walk slowly.
First, I go to a fruit cart.
